#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:36
msgid "Listening for an event"
msgstr "Lytte efter et event"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:38
msgid ""
"To *subscribe* to a template event, we must create a *listener*, a template "
"file with exactly the same name as the identifier of the template event we "
"want to use, and place it in the ``event/`` subdirectory of a style’s "
"template folder."
msgstr ""
"For at *abonnere* på et modelevent skal vi oprette en *listener*, en "
"modelfil med nøjagtig samme navn som identifikatoren for det modelevent, vi "
"vil bruge, og placere den i undermappen ``event/`` i et styles modelmappe."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:42
msgid ""
"For example, we will use the ``overall_header_navigation_prepend`` event to "
"add a new link before the existing links in the board's navigation bar. The "
"listener for this event will be:"
msgstr ""
"Vi bruger f.eks. eventet ``overall_header_navigation_prepend`` til at "
"tilføje et nyt link før de eksisterende links i forummets navigationslinje. "
"Listeneren for dette event vil være:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:52
msgid ""
"If you want a template listener to be used by all styles, it should be "
"placed in the ``all/`` style directory, e.g. "
"``vendor/extname/styles/all/template/event/``. This helps prevent code "
"duplication and eases style file management."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du vil have en modellistener brugt af alle styles, bør den placeres i "
"style-mappen ``all/``, f.eks. ``vendor/extname/styles/all/template/event/``."
" Dette hjælper med at undgå kodeduplikering og letter håndteringen af style-"
"filer."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:56
msgid ""
"The prosilver and subsilver2 directories should be used for template files "
"that must be custom tailored to each style. Similarly, if a 3rd-party style "
"requires additional customisation to maintain compatibility, a folder for "
"that style should be included with those template files."
msgstr ""
"Mapperne prosilver og subsilver2 bør bruges til modelfiler, der skal "
"skræddersys til hver style. På samme måde bør, hvis et tredjepartsstyle "
"kræver yderligere tilpasning for at bevare kompatibilitet, en mappe til det "
"style inkluderes med disse modelfiler."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:61
msgid ""
"To add ACP template listeners, place those files in "
"``vendor/extname/adm/style/event/``."
msgstr ""
"For at tilføje ACP-modellisteners skal disse filer placeres i "
"``vendor/extname/adm/style/event/``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:63
msgid ""
"Inside the template listener, we will create a nav-bar link. This consists "
"of a simple list element, with a link and a description:"
msgstr ""
"Inde i modellisteneren opretter vi et link til navigationslinjen. Dette "
"består af et simpelt listeelement med et link og en beskrivelse:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:74
msgid ""
"Once the template listener has been created, you should be able to see the "
"new link in the board's nav-bar, with the icon of the FAQ link and the text "
"``DEMO_PAGE``. We will fix the link text in the next section."
msgstr ""
"Når modellisteneren er oprettet, bør du kunne se det nye link i forummets "
"navigationslinje, med ikonet fra FAQ-linket og teksten ``DEMO_PAGE``. Vi "
"retter linkteksten i næste afsnit."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:80
msgid ""
"If the link does not appear, you may need to purge the board cache from the "
"main page of the ACP. You can also enable ``DEBUG_MODE`` in your "
"``config.php`` file, which will force the template engine to always look for"
" template listeners when a page is being rendered."
msgstr ""
"Hvis linket ikke vises, skal du muligvis rydde forummets cache fra "
"hovedsiden i ACP. Du kan også aktivere ``DEBUG_MODE`` i din "
"``config.php``-fil, hvilket tvinger modelmotoren til altid at kigge efter "
"modellisteners, når en side renderes."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:85
msgid ""
"It's important to understand that when phpBB compiles the templates, there "
"is no current system for determining the priority in which template "
"listeners from different extensions subscribed to the same event are "
"compiled. In rare cases some extensions could cause a conflict, in which "
"case the recommendation is for the extension authors to work together on a "
"solution for their conflicting template listeners."
msgstr ""
"Det er vigtigt at forstå, at når phpBB kompilerer modellerne, findes der i "
"øjeblikket ikke noget system til at bestemme prioriteten, hvormed "
"modellisteners fra forskellige udvidelser, der abonnerer på det samme event,"
" kompileres. I sjældne tilfælde kan nogle udvidelser forårsage en konflikt, "
"og i så fald anbefales det, at udvidelsesforfatterne samarbejder om en "
"løsning for deres modstridende modellisteners."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:94
msgid "PHP Core Events & Listeners"
msgstr "PHP-kerneevents og listeners"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:96
msgid ""
"Events allow extensions to execute code in many locations within core phpBB "
"code, without modifying any of the code. That way extensions can easily add "
"features, remove functionality or modify behaviour, while maintaining "
"compatibility and simple update procedures."
msgstr ""
"Events giver udvidelser mulighed for at eksekvere kode mange steder inden "
"for phpBB's kernekode, uden at ændre nogen af koden. På den måde kan "
"udvidelser nemt tilføje funktioner, fjerne funktionalitet eller ændre "
"adfærd, samtidig med at de bevarer kompatibiliteten og enkle "
"opdateringsprocedurer."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:102
msgid "Terminology"
msgstr "Terminologi"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:104
msgid "Events"
msgstr "Events"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:105
msgid ""
"Events are dispatched at various places in the core phpBB code. Listeners in"
" extensions subscribe to these events. They are able to execute code "
"whenever the respective event has occurred. An alternative name for events "
"is “hook locations”."
msgstr ""
"Events udsendes forskellige steder i phpBB's kernekode. Listeners i "
"udvidelser abonnerer på disse events. De kan eksekvere kode, hver gang det "
"respektive event opstår. Et alternativt navn for events er \"hook-"
"placeringer\" (\"hook locations\")."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:109
msgid "Listeners"
msgstr "Listeners"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:110
msgid ""
"Listeners are triggered by events. They are methods that can process "
"incoming data and manipulate variables in the scope of the event. So they "
"can change phpBB's behaviour, add new functionality or if used in the "
"context of templates, modify the output. Numerous listeners form part of a "
"subscriber. An alternative name for listeners is \"hooks\"."
msgstr ""
"Listeners udløses af events. De er metoder, der kan behandle indgående data "
"og manipulere variabler i eventets scope. De kan derfor ændre phpBB's "
"adfærd, tilføje ny funktionalitet eller, hvis de bruges i forbindelse med "
"modeller, ændre outputtet. Talrige listeners udgør en del af en subscriber. "
"Et alternativt navn for listeners er \"hooks\"."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:118
msgid ""
"View the full list of supported `PHP events "
"<https://area51.phpbb.com/docs/dev/3.3.x/extensions/events_list.html#php-"
"events>`_."
msgstr ""
"Se den fulde liste over understøttede `PHP-events "
"<https://area51.phpbb.com/docs/dev/3.3.x/extensions/events_list.html#php-"
"events>`_."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:121
msgid "The event listener"
msgstr "Event-listeneren"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:123
msgid ""
"In the previous section we created a template listener that adds a link for "
"the Acme Demo extension to phpBB's nav-bar. We will now use PHP events to "
"load a language file that contains the ``DEMO_PAGE`` language key so that "
"our nav-bar link will display with the correct text."
msgstr ""
"I det foregående afsnit oprettede vi en modellistener, der tilføjer et link "
"til Acme Demo-udvidelsen i phpBB's navigationslinje. Vi vil nu bruge PHP-"
"events til at indlæse en sprogfil, der indeholder sprognøglen ``DEMO_PAGE``,"
" så vores link i navigationslinjen vises med den korrekte tekst."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:128
msgid ""
"To do so, we need to create a PHP event listener class (a.k.a. subscriber "
"class). This class includes a set of listener methods, each of which can "
"*subscribe* to PHP events in phpBB's codebase. The listener class must be "
"created in the ``event/`` subdirectory of the extension directory or it will"
" not work. It must also conform to the following requirements:"
msgstr ""
"For at gøre dette skal vi oprette en PHP-event-listener-klasse (også kaldet "
"en subscriber-klasse). Denne klasse indeholder et sæt listener-metoder, som "
"hver kan *abonnere* på PHP-events i phpBB's kodebase. Listener-klassen skal "
"oprettes i undermappen ``event/`` i udvidelsesmappen, ellers virker det "
"ikke. Den skal også overholde følgende krav:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:134
msgid ""
"Follow extension class name-spacing conventions: "
"``vendor\\extname\\event\\subscribername.php``."
msgstr ""
"Følg konventionerne for navngivning af udvidelsesklasser med namespace: "
"``vendor\\extname\\event\\subscribername.php``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:135
msgid ""
"Implement Symfony's "
"``Symfony\\Component\\EventDispatcher\\EventSubscriberInterface`` interface."
msgstr ""
"Implementér Symfony's interface "
"``Symfony\\Component\\EventDispatcher\\EventSubscriberInterface``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:137
msgid ""
"Use the static method ``getSubscribedEvents()`` to subscribe methods in the "
"listener to specific events, the keys of which contain event names and the "
"values of which contain listener function names."
msgstr ""
"Brug den statiske metode ``getSubscribedEvents()`` til at abonnere metoder i"
" listeneren på specifikke events, hvis nøgler indeholder eventnavne, og hvis"
" værdier indeholder listener-funktionsnavne."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:141
msgid ""
"In the Acme Demo extension, we want to load our language file everywhere. "
"Therefore we will subscribe a listener function to phpBB's "
"``core.user_setup`` event:"
msgstr ""
"I Acme Demo-udvidelsen vil vi indlæse vores sprogfil overalt. Derfor vil vi "
"abonnere en listener-funktion på phpBB's event ``core.user_setup``:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:183
msgid "So what is the ``main_listener.php`` class above actually doing?"
msgstr "Så hvad gør klassen ``main_listener.php`` ovenfor egentlig?"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:185
msgid ""
"The ``getSubscribedEvents()`` method is subscribing our listener function "
"``load_language_on_setup()`` to the event named ``core.user_setup``. This "
"means that when this event occurs, our function will execute."
msgstr ""
"Metoden ``getSubscribedEvents()`` abonnerer vores listener-funktion "
"``load_language_on_setup()`` på eventet ved navn ``core.user_setup``. Dette "
"betyder, at når dette event opstår, vil vores funktion blive eksekveret."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:191
msgid ""
"You can assign multiple listener functions to a single event using an array:"
msgstr ""
"Du kan tildele flere listener-funktioner til et enkelt event ved hjælp af et"
" array:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:197
msgid ""
"The ``load_language_on_setup()`` listener method simply adds our language "
"file to phpBB's language data array. Generally speaking, a listener is "
"simply a public function in the subscriber class, referred to in the array "
"returned by ``getSubscribedEvents()``. It takes one argument, ``$event``. "
"This parameter allows you to access and modify the variables that are given "
"to the event from the core code. In this case we are modifying the "
"``lang_set_ext`` variable by adding Acme Demo's language file to it."
msgstr ""
"Listener-metoden ``load_language_on_setup()`` tilføjer simpelthen vores "
"sprogfil til phpBB's sprogdataarray. Generelt er en listener blot en "
"offentlig funktion i subscriber-klassen, som refereres til i det array, der "
"returneres af ``getSubscribedEvents()``. Den tager ét argument, ``$event``. "
"Denne parameter giver dig mulighed for at tilgå og ændre de variabler, der "
"gives til eventet fra kernekoden. I dette tilfælde ændrer vi variablen "
"``lang_set_ext`` ved at tilføje Acme Demos sprogfil til den."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:207
msgid ""
"Note how the ``lang_set_ext`` event variable is first copied by assigning it"
" to a local variable, then modified, and then copied back. This shortcut "
"does not work: ``$event['foo']['bar'] = $baz;`` This is because the event "
"variables are overloaded, which is a limitation in PHP."
msgstr ""
"Bemærk, hvordan event-variablen ``lang_set_ext`` først kopieres ved at "
"tildele den til en lokal variabel, derefter ændres og til sidst kopieres "
"tilbage. Denne genvej fungerer ikke: ``$event['foo']['bar'] = $baz;`` Dette "
"skyldes, at event-variablerne er overloaded, hvilket er en begrænsning i "
"PHP."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:213
msgid "Registering the listener"
msgstr "Registrering af listeneren"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:215
msgid ""
"To have phpBB autoload and execute our event listener class, we need to "
"create a service definition for it. This is done by creating a "
"``config/services.yml`` file in the extension:"
msgstr ""
"For at få phpBB til at autoloade og eksekvere vores event-listener-klasse "
"skal vi oprette en servicedefinition for den. Dette gøres ved at oprette en "
"fil ``config/services.yml`` i udvidelsen:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:229
msgid ""
"YAML files are indentation sensitive. They require an indentation size of 4 "
"spaces per indent, **do not use tabs**."
msgstr ""
"YAML-filer er følsomme over for indrykning. De kræver en "
"indrykningsstørrelse på 4 mellemrum pr. niveau, **brug ikke tabulatorer**."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:232
msgid ""
"The first line tells phpBB that a list of services is being registered. On "
"the next line we specify the name of the service, which is for our event "
"listener in this case."
msgstr ""
"Den første linje fortæller phpBB, at en liste over services registreres. På "
"den næste linje angiver vi navnet på servicen, som i dette tilfælde er til "
"vores event-listener."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:238
msgid "Service names must be prefixed with your vendor and extension name."
msgstr "Servicenavne skal være præfikset med dit vendor- og udvidelsesnavn."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:240
msgid ""
"The ``class`` attribute must contain the name-space and class name of the "
"service being registered. The name-space depends on the file's location, "
"within the ``ext/`` directory. Thus, the file "
"``ext/acme/demo/event/main_listener.php`` has the namespace "
"``acme\\demo\\event`` and class name ``main_listener``. The full name of the"
" class is therefore ``acme\\demo\\event\\main_listener`` which is what we "
"need to specify here."
msgstr ""
"Attributten ``class`` skal indeholde namespacet og klassenavnet for den "
"service, der registreres. Namespacet afhænger af filens placering inden for "
"mappen ``ext/``. Filen ``ext/acme/demo/event/main_listener.php`` har således"
" namespacet ``acme\\demo\\event`` og klassenavnet ``main_listener``. "
"Klassens fulde navn er derfor ``acme\\demo\\event\\main_listener``, som er "
"det, vi skal angive her."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:247
msgid ""
"The ``tags`` attribute tells phpBB that the service is an event listener."
msgstr ""
"Attributten ``tags`` fortæller phpBB, at servicen er en event-listener."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:249
msgid ""
"Once the services YAML file has been created (or modified), phpBB's cache "
"needs to be purged. After purging the cache in the ACP, the description of "
"the link in the navigation bar should now display ``Demo`` instead of "
"``DEMO_PAGE``."
msgstr ""
"Når YAML-filen for services er oprettet (eller ændret), skal phpBB's cache "
"ryddes. Efter rydning af cachen i ACP bør beskrivelsen af linket i "
"navigationslinjen nu vise ``Demo`` i stedet for ``DEMO_PAGE``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:256
msgid ""
"phpBB’s core PHP and template files have been prepared with dozens of event "
"locations. However, if there are no events where your extension may need "
"one, the phpBB development team welcomes event requests at the `area51.com "
"Event Requests <https://area51.phpbb.com/phpBB/viewforum.php?f=111>`_ forum."
msgstr ""
"phpBB's kerne-PHP- og modelfiler er blevet forberedt med snesevis af "
"eventplaceringer. Hvis der imidlertid ikke findes nogen events, hvor din "
"udvidelse måtte have brug for et, byder phpBB-udviklingsteamet velkommen til"
" eventønsker på forummet `area51.com Event Requests "
"<https://area51.phpbb.com/phpBB/viewforum.php?f=111>`_."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:262
msgid "Prioritising event listeners (optional)"
msgstr "Prioritering af event-listeners (valgfrit)"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:264
msgid ""
"Sometimes different extensions can run into problems when competing for use "
"of the same PHP core events. In trying to resolve these issues, the "
"extension developer may want to prioritise their extension over others, so "
"that their extension will be triggered before other extensions."
msgstr ""
"Nogle gange kan forskellige udvidelser løbe ind i problemer, når de "
"konkurrerer om brugen af de samme PHP-kerneevents. I forsøget på at løse "
"disse problemer vil udvidelsesudvikleren måske gerne prioritere sin "
"udvidelse over andre, så deres udvidelse udløses før andre udvidelser."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:269
msgid ""
"In such cases, the ``getSubscribedEvents()`` method provides an argument for"
" setting a priority for event listener methods. For example:"
msgstr ""
"I sådanne tilfælde giver metoden ``getSubscribedEvents()`` et argument til "
"at sætte en prioritet for event-listener-metoder. F.eks.:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:281
msgid ""
"In this example, ``$priority`` is an integer, the value of which defaults to"
" 0. Setting this integer to higher values equals more importance and "
"therefore that listener will be triggered earlier than others subscribed to "
"this event."
msgstr ""
"I dette eksempel er ``$priority`` et heltal, hvis værdi som standard er 0. "
"At sætte dette heltal til højere værdier svarer til større vigtighed, og "
"derfor vil den listener blive udløst tidligere end andre, der abonnerer på "
"dette event."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:285
msgid ""
"We have now used events and listeners to modify phpBB and insert a nice link"
" into the nav-bar. However, the link still does not work yet. Continue on to"
" the next section to learn how to use controllers and routing to make our "
"nav-bar link open up a custom user facing page."
msgstr ""
"Vi har nu brugt events og listeners til at ændre phpBB og indsætte et pænt "
"link i navigationslinjen. Linket virker dog stadig ikke endnu. Fortsæt til "
"næste afsnit for at lære, hvordan man bruger controllere og routing til at "
"få vores link i navigationslinjen til at åbne en brugerdefineret side rettet"
" mod brugeren."
